          "name": "Plan",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "description": "A plan in cards: what it is for, its phases and the steps in them, the milestones that gate a phase, what could go wrong and the limits it lives within. Its views are derived from the cards, so the plan is readable without opening it.",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-08T00:38:18.644Z"
        },
