        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail",
          "scroll": "page"
        },
        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;background:#f6faf9;font-family:Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;min-height:100%;padding:4.4cqw 7cqw 5cqw'><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e'>Plan <span style='display:inline-block;padding:.3cqw 1.3cqw;border-radius:9cqw;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;color:#64748b;border:1px solid #64748b'>Draft</span></div><div style='font:700 5.2cqw/1.12 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#1f2937'>Name the aim</div><div style='font:400 2.1cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:2cqw;max-width:62cqw'>What the plan is for, and how you will know it has been reached.</div><div style='margin-top:1.6cqw;font:600 1.6cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b'>2 phases · 1 of 3 steps done · 0 of 1 milestone reached · 1 risk</div><div style='margin-top:2.6cqw;padding:1.4cqw 2cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:600 1.5cqw/1.5 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>1 thing to check: A step in the second phase</div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(15,118,110,.35)'>Within these limits</div><div style='margin-bottom:1.4cqw'><div style='font:700 1.8cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>A limit to live within</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>A budget, a date, a rule: something the plan has to fit inside.</div></div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(15,118,110,.35)'>The plan</div><div style='margin-bottom:3cqw;padding:2.2cqw 2.6cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;align-items:baseline'><div style='font:700 2.2cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'><span style='color:#4338ca;font:700 1.4cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;margin-right:1.4cqw'>PHASE 1</span>First phase</div><div style='flex:0 0 auto'><span style='display:inline-block;padding:.3cqw 1.3cqw;border-radius:9cqw;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;color:#4338ca;border:1px solid #4338ca'>Underway</span><span style='margin-left:1.2cqw;font:600 1.4cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b'>1/2</span></div></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>What this stretch of the work is for.</div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.4cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:1cqw'><span style='color:#0369a1;font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>☑</span><span style='font:400 1.65cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>A first step</b><br>What doing it means.</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.4cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:1cqw'><span style='color:#0369a1;font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>◐</span><span style='font:400 1.65cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>A second step</b><br>What comes next in this phase.</span></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:3cqw;padding:2.2cqw 2.6cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;align-items:baseline'><div style='font:700 2.2cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'><span style='color:#4338ca;font:700 1.4cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;margin-right:1.4cqw'>PHASE 2</span>Second phase</div><div style='flex:0 0 auto'><span style='display:inline-block;padding:.3cqw 1.3cqw;border-radius:9cqw;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;color:#64748b;border:1px solid #64748b'>Not started</span><span style='margin-left:1.2cqw;font:600 1.4cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b'>0/1</span></div></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>What comes after the first, and what it produces.</div><div style='margin-top:.8cqw;font:600 1.5cqw/1.5 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#b45309'>Begins when: A point to reach — not yet reached · the first phase is finished</div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.4cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:1cqw'><span style='color:#0369a1;font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>☐</span><span style='font:400 1.65cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>A step in the second phase</b><span style='display:inline-block;margin-left:1cqw;padding:.2cqw 1cqw;border-radius:9cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle'>to check</span><br>A step you are not sure of is marked to check.</span></div></div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(15,118,110,.35)'>What could go wrong</div><div style='margin-bottom:2.2cqw;padding:2cqw 2.4cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #fecaca'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;align-items:baseline'><div style='font:700 2cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Something could go wrong</div><div style='flex:0 0 auto'><span style='display:inline-block;padding:.3cqw 1.3cqw;border-radius:9cqw;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;color:#b91c1c;border:1px solid #b91c1c'>Possible</span></div></div><div style='font:600 1.4cqw/1.5 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b;margin-top:.6cqw'>Threatens: A step in the second phase</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>What goes wrong, and what it would cost.</div><div style='margin-top:1cqw;font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='color:#b91c1c'>Reduces it:</b> What you do now to make it less likely.</div><div style='margin-top:.6cqw;font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='color:#b91c1c'>If it happens:</b> What you do if it happens anyway.</div></div></div></div>"
        },
        "memo": "The Detail: the plan as a document, phase by phase, written from the cards. The Method writes it, so edit the cards and not this.",
        "link": "",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1793398054115,
